# ── Optional: serve the frontend's data APIs from PostgreSQL ───────────────
# Copy to .env.local and uncomment to switch READ paths (courses list,
# sessions + notes/transcript markdown, deadlines, checklists, mapping) from
# the filesystem/daemon to the Postgres schema in src/db/schema.ts (root
# repo). Unset ⇒ default fs behavior, byte-identical to today.
# Writes (ingest, fold/toggle, mapping edits) still go through the daemon.

# DB_READS=1

# Server-side only — NEVER prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_. When unset, pg falls
# back to the standard PGHOST/PGUSER/PGPASSWORD/PGDATABASE/PGPORT env vars.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://autoschool:***@127.0.0.1:15432/autoschool
